WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.450
Let’s take weekly attendance for your class.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.870
Open Attendance, and check the class and meeting date.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:13.290
Use the name sorting control to find children quickly.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:18.616
For each child, choose Present, Late, or Absent. The marks save automatically.

00:00:18.936 --> 00:00:23.360
Made a mistake? Select the correct mark, and wait for saving to complete.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:28.798
Before finishing, check the number still unmarked and review any waiting QR requests.

00:00:29.118 --> 00:00:34.576
Finish marks everyone still unmarked absent and closes QR check-in for that meeting.

00:00:34.896 --> 00:00:39.349
Check the saved confirmation. History lets you review earlier attendance.
